<title>FRANCE: Cap Gemini up on Debis speculation.</title>
<headline>Cap Gemini up on Debis speculation.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Cap Gemini Sogeti were up 8.60 francs at 247.90 at 1045 GMT on after Daimler-Benz's Debis reiterated its interest in raising its stake in Cap Gemini, brokers said.</p>
<p>Debis holds 24.4 percent of Cap Gemini, and its chairman Klaus Mangold said in Berlin that he was interested in raising the stake once U.S. legislation allowed.</p>
<p>He also said talks were on for the acquisition by Debis and Cap Gemini of GSI from U.S. firm ADP. The acquisition would reinforce Cap Gemini's information services activities, brokers said.</p>
